# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FILE MAU — chep thanh web/.env.local roi dien gia tri that:
#     cp .env.local.example .env.local
# Ban that (web/.env.local) KHONG duoc git theo doi vi chua mat khau.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Chuoi ket noi PostgreSQL toi CSDL `nro` cua may chu game.
#
# CANH BAO — SO CONG 5433 DUOI DAY LA SO CHET, DUNG TIN. TU KIEM TRUOC KHI CHAY.
# PostgreSQL tren may dev khong chay nhu dich vu Windows, va cong doi giua cac
# lan khoi dong: postgresql.conf de mac dinh 5432, nhung ai bat bang
# `pg_ctl ... -o "-p 5433"` thi no nghe 5433. Ghim so nao vao day cung sai —
# cach dung la tu kiem, 1 dong PowerShell:
#
#     Get-NetTCPConnection -State Listen | Where-Object { $_.LocalPort -in 5432,5433 } | Select-Object LocalPort
#
# Khong in ra gi = PostgreSQL chua bat:
#     D:\PostgreSQL\bin\pg_ctl.exe -D D:\PostgreSQL\data start
#
# Trieu chung khi dien sai cong: web van len, nhung moi trang cham CSDL bao
# `connectex: ... actively refused it`. Trong het suc giong loi code, that ra
# chi la sai so. Chi tiet: BAT-DAU-TU-DAY.md muc 3 va muc 9.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:nrodev123@127.0.0.1:5433/nro

# Khoa bi mat de ky cookie phien (JWT). Doi thanh mot chuoi ngau nhien that dai
# truoc khi chay that. Doi khoa nay = moi phien dang nhap hien co het hieu luc.
AUTH_SECRET=doi-thanh-chuoi-ngau-nhien
